  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <h3>Material Defaults</h3>
  <p>Using <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL" target="_blank">PRIM_MATERIAL</a> changes the the values for friction and restitution to the values listed for the material type.</p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>material Flags</th>
        <th></th>
        <th colspan="4">Description</th>
        <th><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=FRICTION&action=edit&redlink=1" target="_blank">Friction</a></th>
        <th><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/RESTITUTION" target="_blank">Restitution</a></th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL_STONE" target="_blank">PRIM_MATERIAL_STONE</a></td>
        <td>0</td>
        <td colspan="4">stone</td>
        <td>0.8</td>
        <td>0.4</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL_METAL" target="_blank">PRIM_MATERIAL_METAL</a></td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td colspan="4">metal</td>
        <td>0.3</td>
        <td>0.4</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL_GLASS" target="_blank">PRIM_MATERIAL_GLASS</a></td>
        <td>2</td>
        <td colspan="4">glass</td>
        <td>0.2</td>
        <td>0.7</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL_WOOD" target="_blank">PRIM_MATERIAL_WOOD</a></td>
        <td>3</td>
        <td colspan="4">wood</td>
        <td>0.6</td>
        <td>0.5</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL_FLESH" target="_blank">PRIM_MATERIAL_FLESH</a></td>
        <td>4</td>
        <td colspan="4">flesh</td>
        <td>0.9</td>
        <td>0.3</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL_PLASTIC" target="_blank">PRIM_MATERIAL_PLASTIC</a></td>
        <td>5</td>
        <td colspan="4">plastic</td>
        <td>0.4</td>
        <td>0.7</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL_RUBBER" target="_blank">PRIM_MATERIAL_RUBBER</a></td>
        <td>6</td>
        <td colspan="4">rubber</td>
        <td>0.9</td>
        <td>0.9</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_MATERIAL_LIGHT" target="_blank">PRIM_MATERIAL_LIGHT</a></td>
        <td>7</td>
        <td colspan="6">light, <b>DEPRECATED</b>: Looks the same as <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_FULLBRIGHT" target="_blank"> [PRIM_FULLBRIGHT</a>, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a>, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> ]</td>
        <td>0.6</td>
        <td>0.5</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>llSetPhysicsMaterial cannot use these flags.</p>
